{"topic": "Gradient Descent and Learning Rate", "audience": "", "referenceMaterial": "[none provided]", "allowedTypes": {"chart": "Author a chart block for a LectureDoc lecture — a data chart (bar/line/area/scatter) rendered via Observable Plot, theme-aware. Reach for it whenever a page shows numeric comparison, trend over time, share/composition, or correlation — anything where seeing the shape of the numbers beats reading them. Prefer a chart over a table when magnitude/trend/relationship is the point; use a table only for exact nominal lookup where values are not being compared. Produces schema-valid chart block JSON.", "runnable": "Author a runnable (edit → Run) code cell block for a LectureDoc lecture — an in-browser Python (Pyodide) + JavaScript editor with a console and a result chart. Reach for it whenever the student should learn by writing/modifying and actually executing code themselves: implementing an algorithm by hand, tuning parameters and seeing the effect, exploratory what-if coding. Use a plain `code` block instead for read-only display the student will not run. Produces schema-valid runnable block JSON.", "hero": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "statement": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "pullquote": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "list": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "agenda": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "callout": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "formula": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "flow": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "table": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "code": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "compare": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "grid": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "timeline": "Author static content blocks for a LectureDoc lecture page — hero, statement, list, agenda, callout, formula, flow, table, code, compare, grid. Use when a lecture needs prose/narrative/layout (not an interactive sim, quiz, or code runtime). Produces schema-valid block JSON.", "freeform": "Author a freeform block for a LectureDoc lecture — the long-tail fallback for a visual relationship that none of the formal block types can express, drawn as inline SVG/HTML restricted to theme colour tokens. Reach for it only after checking the structured types: graph covers trees, DAGs and branching flowcharts; chart covers data; diagram covers fixed shapes; grid and sim.widget cover custom layouts and interactive pieces. When it genuinely is the right tool it now renders as normal page content, so use it without hedging. Produces schema-valid freeform block JSON.", "stats": "Author stats (KPI number cards), diagram (fixed structural shapes — cycle/pyramid/staircase/snake/arrow-seq/circular-grid/connected-circles) and graph (true node-edge trees, DAGs and branching flowcharts, rendered as real layered SVG) blocks for a LectureDoc lecture. Reach for stats to spotlight a handful of standalone key numbers; reach for graph whenever nodes have *named relationships* — parent/child, dependency, branch, merge — since it is the only block type with an edges field; reach for diagram only for a fixed decorative shape with no explicit edges. Use flow for a simple linear 2-3 step sequence. Produces schema-valid stats/diagram/graph block JSON.", "diagram": "Author stats (KPI number cards), diagram (fixed structural shapes — cycle/pyramid/staircase/snake/arrow-seq/circular-grid/connected-circles) and graph (true node-edge trees, DAGs and branching flowcharts, rendered as real layered SVG) blocks for a LectureDoc lecture. Reach for stats to spotlight a handful of standalone key numbers; reach for graph whenever nodes have *named relationships* — parent/child, dependency, branch, merge — since it is the only block type with an edges field; reach for diagram only for a fixed decorative shape with no explicit edges. Use flow for a simple linear 2-3 step sequence. Produces schema-valid stats/diagram/graph block JSON.", "graph": "Author stats (KPI number cards), diagram (fixed structural shapes — cycle/pyramid/staircase/snake/arrow-seq/circular-grid/connected-circles) and graph (true node-edge trees, DAGs and branching flowcharts, rendered as real layered SVG) blocks for a LectureDoc lecture. Reach for stats to spotlight a handful of standalone key numbers; reach for graph whenever nodes have *named relationships* — parent/child, dependency, branch, merge — since it is the only block type with an edges field; reach for diagram only for a fixed decorative shape with no explicit edges. Use flow for a simple linear 2-3 step sequence. Produces schema-valid stats/diagram/graph block JSON.", "quiz": "Author a quiz block for a LectureDoc lecture — objective (multiple-choice, auto-graded) or subjective (open discussion prompt). Reach for it whenever a page should check understanding or provoke reflection rather than only present — at least one per lecture is encouraged. Objective for a checkable fact/skill, subjective for open-ended thinking. Produces schema-valid quiz block JSON.", "sim": "Author a sim (simulation) block for a LectureDoc lecture — a parameter-driven interactive that recomputes and redraws in-browser as the student changes inputs. Reach for it whenever a quantitative or mechanistic process becomes clearer by letting the student turn a knob and watch the outcome change (physics/chem dynamics, algorithm behaviour, parameter sensitivity); pick a sim over a static chart when the interaction itself is the teaching point. Engines are chosen at build time: dynamics1d/searchCompare (declarative restricted-expression math → line charts), custom (sandboxed compute), widget (live canvas/SVG animation, geometric construction, or arbitrary mouse interaction). Skip it when the topic has no quantifiable/mechanistic process to manipulate — a sim with no real parameter to turn is decoration, not interaction. Produces schema-valid sim block JSON."}, "currentBrief": {"objective": "学生能用下山比喻解释负梯度方向与步长的作用", "keyClaim": "梯度下降 = 每次沿负梯度方向走一小步，步长由学习率控制", "misconception": "认为梯度方向就是下降方向", "visualTask": "二维损失曲面上的等高线图，显示从起点沿负梯度方向逐步逼近最低点的路径", "evidencePolicy": "synthetic"}, "currentScene": {"id": "downhill-analogy", "kind": "content", "eyebrow": "直觉入门", "headline": "下山比喻：每一步沿最陡方向走一小步", "lead": "梯度是函数增长最快的方向，负梯度就是下降最快的方向。", "notes": "用几何和比喻让初学者理解核心思想", "blocks": [{"type": "list", "items": [{"lead": "方向", "text": "每一步都沿着**最陡的下坡方向**——即负梯度方向，而不是任意方向。", "icon": "compass"}, {"lead": "步长", "text": "每一步迈多大由*学习率*控制：步长太大可能跨过谷底，太小则收敛极慢。", "icon": "book-open"}, {"lead": "迭代", "text": "重复「找方向 → 迈一步」的过程，直到到达谷底（损失不再明显下降）。", "icon": "trending-down"}], "id": "b1"}, {"type": "sim", "engine": "widget", "html": "<style>
  .lab-widget {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-radius: var(--radius, 12px);
    padding: 16px 20px 20px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .stage-wrap {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .stage-wrap svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius, 8px);
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px 16px;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .ctrl-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .ctrl-group label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text2);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ctrl-group input[type=range] {
    width: 80px;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity .15s;
  }
  .ctrl-group input[type=range]:hover { opacity: .85; }
  .ctrl-group .val {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
    min-width: 40px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .btn-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .btn-group button {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius, 6px);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .15s, border-color .15s, transform .1s;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .btn-group button:hover { background: var(--bg2); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-group button:active { transform: scale(.96); }
  .btn-group button.prim {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .btn-group button.prim:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }
  .readout-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 2px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .readout-row .mono {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .readout-row .accent { color: var(--accent); }
  .flash {
    transition: color .3s ease;
  }
</style>
<div class="lab-widget">
  <div class="stage-wrap">
    <svg id="stage" viewBox="0 0 680 360" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <!-- 网格线 -->
      <g id="grid" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4">
        <line x1="40" y1="0" x2="40" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="120" y1="0" x2="120" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="200" y1="0" x2="200" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="280" y1="0" x2="280" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="360" y1="0" x2="360" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="440" y1="0" x2="440" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="520" y1="0" x2="520" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="600" y1="0" x2="600" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="0" y1="40" x2="680" y2="40"/>
        <line x1="0" y1="120" x2="680" y2="120"/>
        <line x1="0" y1="200" x2="680" y2="200"/>
        <line x1="0" y1="280" x2="680" y2="280"/>
      </g>
      <!-- 抛物线 f(x)=x^2 映射：x∈[-2,2] → px∈[40,640], y∈[0,4] → py∈[340,20] -->
      <path id="parabola" d="M 40 340 Q 340 20 640 340" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6"/>
      <!-- 坐标轴 -->
      <line x1="40" y1="340" x2="640" y2="340" stroke="var(--text2)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
      <line x1="340" y1="20" x2="340" y2="360" stroke="var(--text2)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
      <!-- 刻度标签 -->
      <text x="40" y="358" fill="var(--text2)" font-size="10" font-family="var(--mono)" text-anchor="middle">-2</text>
      <text x="340" y="358" fill="var(--text2)" font-size="10" font-family="var(--mono)" text-anchor="middle">0</text>
      <text x="640" y="358" fill="var(--text2)" font-size="10" font-family="var(--mono)" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
      <text x="24" y="24" fill="var(--text2)" font-size="11" font-family="var(--mono)">f(x)=x²</text>
      <!-- 动态轨迹组：点、箭头、轨迹线、标注 -->
      <g id="trajectory">
        <path id="tracePath" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.7"/>
        <!-- 点由 js 动态生成 -->
      </g>
      <!-- 当前步标注 -->
      <text id="stepLabel" x="16" y="340" fill="var(--accent)" font-size="13" font-family="var(--mono)" font-variant-numeric="tabular-nums"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <div class="ctrl-group">
      <label for="x0">起点 x₀</label>
      <input type="range" id="x0" min="-2.0" max="2.0" step="0.01" value="1.5">
      <span class="val mono" id="x0Val">1.50</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ctrl-group">
      <label for="lr">学习率 η</label>
      <input type="range" id="lr" min="0.01" max="0.5" step="0.01" value="0.1">
      <span class="val mono" id="lrVal">0.10</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ctrl-group">
      <label for="steps">步数</label>
      <input type="range" id="steps" min="0" max="20" step="1" value="5">
      <span class="val mono" id="stepsVal">5</span>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button id="stepBack" title="后退一步">◀</button>
      <button id="stepForward" class="prim" title="前进一步">▶</button>
      <button id="reset" title="重置到起点">⟲</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="readout-row">
    <span>当前步: <span class="mono accent" id="currentStepDisplay">0</span> / <span class="mono" id="totalStepsDisplay">5</span></span>
    <span>当前位置 x: <span class="mono accent" id="currentXDisplay">—</span></span>
    <span>f(x): <span class="mono accent" id="currentFDisplay">—</span></span>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function() {
    const root = document.documentElement;
    const tok = n => getComputedStyle(root).getPropertyValue(n).trim();

    // state
    let x0 = 1.5;
    let learningRate = 0.1;
    let steps = 5;
    let currentStep = 5; // 初始显示5步

    // DOM refs
    const svg = document.getElementById('stage');
    const tracePath = document.getElementById('tracePath');
    const stepLabel = document.getElementById('stepLabel');
    const x0Input = document.getElementById('x0');
    const x0Val = document.getElementById('x0Val');
    const lrInput = document.getElementById('lr');
    const lrVal = document.getElementById('lrVal');
    const stepsInput = document.getElementById('steps');
    const stepsVal = document.getElementById('stepsVal');
    const currentStepDisplay = document.getElementById('currentStepDisplay');
    const totalStepsDisplay = document.getElementById('totalStepsDisplay');
    const currentXDisplay = document.getElementById('currentXDisplay');
    const currentFDisplay = document.getElementById('currentFDisplay');
    const stepBackBtn = document.getElementById('stepBack');
    const stepForwardBtn = document.getElementById('stepForward');
    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');

    // 坐标映射: x ∈ [-2, 2] → px ∈ [40, 640]; y ∈ [0, 4] → py ∈ [340, 20]
    function xToPx(x) { return 40 + (x + 2) / 4 * 600; }
    function yToPy(y) { return 340 - y / 4 * 320; }
    function f(x) { return x * x; }

    // 计算梯度下降序列
    function computeTrajectory(x0, lr, n) {
      const pts = [];
      let x = x0;
      for (let i = 0; i <= n; i++) {
        pts.push({ x: x, y: f(x), step: i });
        x = x - lr * 2 * x; // 梯度: 2x
      }
      return pts;
    }

    // 单一 update()
    function update() {
      const pts = computeTrajectory(x0, learningRate, steps);
      const showSteps = Math.min(currentStep, steps);
      const visiblePts = pts.slice(0, showSteps + 1);

      // 构建轨迹路径
      let d = '';
      if (visiblePts.length > 0) {
        d = `M ${xToPx(visiblePts[0].x)} ${yToPy(visiblePts[0].y)}`;
        for (let i = 1; i < visiblePts.length; i++) {
          d += ` L ${xToPx(visiblePts[i].x)} ${yToPy(visiblePts[i].y)}`;
        }
      }
      tracePath.setAttribute('d', d);

      // 清除旧点/箭头/标注 (保留 tracePath 和 stepLabel)
      const g = document.getElementById('trajectory');
      // 移除所有子元素除了 tracePath 和 stepLabel
      const children = g.children;
      const toRemove = [];
      for (let i = 0; i < children.length; i++) {
        const el = children[i];
        if (el.id !== 'tracePath' && el.id !== 'stepLabel') {
          toRemove.push(el);
        }
      }
      toRemove.forEach(el => el.remove());

      // 绘制点、箭头、标注
      const accent = tok('--accent');
      const ink = tok('--ink');
      const text2 = tok('--text2');
      const bg = tok('--bg');
      const line = tok('--line');

      for (let i = 0; i < visiblePts.length; i++) {
        const pt = visiblePts[i];
        const cx = xToPx(pt.x);
        const cy = yToPy(pt.y);
        const isFirst = (i === 0);
        const isLast = (i === visiblePts.length - 1);

        // 点
        const circle = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');
        circle.setAttribute('cx', cx);
        circle.setAttribute('cy', cy);
        circle.setAttribute('r', isFirst ? 6 : (isLast ? 6 : 4));
        circle.setAttribute('fill', isFirst ? accent : (isLast ? 'var(--accent)' : 'var(--ink)'));
        circle.setAttribute('stroke', isFirst || isLast ? 'var(--bg)' : 'none');
        circle.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
        if (isLast) {
          circle.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--accent)');
          // 星形标记用 path 代替
          const star = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
          const s = 8;
          const starD = `M ${cx} ${cy-s} L ${cx+s*0.224} ${cy-s*0.309} L ${cx+s*0.951} ${cy-s*0.309} L ${cx+s*0.363} ${cy+s*0.118} L ${cx+s*0.588} ${cy+s*0.809} L ${cx} ${cy+s*0.382} L ${cx-s*0.588} ${cy+s*0.809} L ${cx-s*0.363} ${cy+s*0.118} L ${cx-s*0.951} ${cy-s*0.309} L ${cx-s*0.224} ${cy-s*0.309} Z`;
          star.setAttribute('d', starD);
          star.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--accent)');
          star.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--bg)');
          star.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1.5');
          star.setAttribute('class', 'converge-star');
          g.appendChild(star);
          // 隐藏圆点
          circle.setAttribute('r', 0);
        }
        g.appendChild(circle);

        // 箭头 (除最后一点)
        if (i < visiblePts.length - 1) {
          const next = visiblePts[i+1];
          const nx = xToPx(next.x);
          const ny = yToPy(next.y);
          const dx = nx - cx;
          const dy = ny - cy;
          const len = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy);
          if (len > 2) {
            const ux = dx / len;
            const uy = dy / len;
            const arrowLen = 10;
            const arrowWidth = 5;
            const midX = cx + dx * 0.5;
            const midY = cy + dy * 0.5;
            const tipX = midX + ux * arrowLen * 0.6;
            const tipY = midY + uy * arrowLen * 0.6;
            const baseX = midX - ux * arrowLen * 0.4;
            const baseY = midY - uy * arrowLen * 0.4;
            const perpX = -uy;
            const perpY = ux;
            const arrow = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'polygon');
            arrow.setAttribute('points', 
              `${tipX},${tipY} ${baseX + perpX * arrowWidth},${baseY + perpY * arrowWidth} ${baseX - perpX * arrowWidth},${baseY - perpY * arrowWidth}`
            );
            arrow.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--accent)');
            arrow.setAttribute('opacity', '0.6');
            g.appendChild(arrow);
          }
        }

        // 标注 (仅首尾和中间关键点)
        if (isFirst || isLast || i === Math.floor(showSteps/2)) {
          const label = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
          label.setAttribute('x', cx + (isFirst ? -12 : 12));
          label.setAttribute('y', cy - (isFirst ? 14 : 10));
          label.setAttribute('fill', isFirst ? 'var(--accent)' : 'var(--text2)');
          label.setAttribute('font-size', '11');
          label.setAttribute('font-family', 'var(--mono)');
          label.setAttribute('text-anchor', isFirst ? 'end' : 'start');
          let txt = '';
          if (isFirst) txt = `x₀=${pt.x.toFixed(2)}`;
          else if (isLast) txt = `★ x=${pt.x.toFixed(2)}`;
          else txt = `x=${pt.x.toFixed(2)}`;
          label.textContent = txt;
          g.appendChild(label);
        }
      }

      // 更新步数标注
      const lastPt = visiblePts[visiblePts.length-1];
      if (lastPt) {
        stepLabel.textContent = `步 ${showSteps}  x=${lastPt.x.toFixed(4)}  f=${lastPt.y.toFixed(4)}`;
      } else {
        stepLabel.textContent = '';
      }

      // 更新读数
      currentStepDisplay.textContent = showSteps;
      totalStepsDisplay.textContent = steps;
      if (lastPt) {
        currentXDisplay.textContent = lastPt.x.toFixed(4);
        currentFDisplay.textContent = lastPt.y.toFixed(4);
      } else {
        currentXDisplay.textContent = '—';
        currentFDisplay.textContent = '—';
      }
    }

    // 事件绑定
    x0Input.addEventListener('input', function() {
      x0 = parseFloat(this.value);
      x0Val.textContent = x0.toFixed(2);
      currentStep = 0;
      update();
    });
    lrInput.addEventListener('input', function() {
      learningRate = parseFloat(this.value);
      lrVal.textContent = learningRate.toFixed(2);
      currentStep = 0;
      update();
    });
    stepsInput.addEventListener('input', function() {
      steps = parseInt(this.value, 10);
      stepsVal.textContent = steps;
      if (currentStep > steps) currentStep = steps;
      update();
    });
    stepForwardBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      if (currentStep < steps) {
        currentStep++;
        update();
      }
    });
    stepBackBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      if (currentStep > 0) {
        currentStep--;
        update();
      }
    });
    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      currentStep = 0;
      update();
    });

    // 初始渲染
    update();
  })();
